Package: isimip
Type: Package
Title: Client for the ISIMIP Repository API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Tadhg", "Moore", email = "tadhg.moore@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Jochen", "Klar", role = "aut", comment = "Original Python implementation")
    )
Description: A thin client library to use the API of the ISIMIP repository 
    (https://data.isimip.org) using R. This package provides methods to query 
    datasets and files, submit processing jobs (cutout, mask, select operations), 
    and download results from the ISIMIP climate impact data repository.
